WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.140
It's a classic office dispute.

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.750
She stole your stapler.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.890
He ate your lunch.

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:09.990
It's gotten bad. And there's only one way to resolve this.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.020
With a cupcake battle!

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:17.660
Player one get ready!

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:24.790
Player two get ready!

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:30.140
The rules are simple. It's like dodgeball.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:33.710
You get hit in the arm, you lose that arm.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:36.920
You get hit in both arms... then you're pretty much screwed.

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:40.840
If you get hit in the leg... you lose that leg.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:45.120
If you get hit in both legs... then you fight from the ground as best as you can.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:49.220
The head or torso... well that's instant death.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:52.610
Catch a cupcake and you get a fatality blow.

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:55.640
Players... Get ready to battle!!!

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:57.250
Miss!

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:00.460
Miss

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:03.670
Leg shot! Leg shot!

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:07.950
Miss!

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:10.620
Leg shot!

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:14.370
Arm shot!

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:21.320
Fair catch.

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:25.070
Fatality Blow!

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:29.350
Sayonara, Sucker!

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.490
GAME OVER! 

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:34.700
Office dispute settled.

